          </div>
          <div class="hotel-item">
            <span><strong>Kimpton Shinjuku Tokyo</strong> — Stylish boutique luxury, pet-friendly, exceptional rooftop terrace and New York-Tokyo fusion.</span>
            <a href="https://www.booking.com/city/jp/tokyo.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hotel-link">Check Rates &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hotel-item">
            <span><strong>Hotel Gracery Shinjuku</strong> — The iconic "Godzilla Hotel" right in the heart of East Shinjuku entertainment. Fantastic mid-range value.</span>
