          </div>
          <div class="hotel-item">
            <span><strong>Asakusa Kokono Club Hotel</strong> — Playful cultural boutique hotel featuring handcrafted woodwork and an artisan ground-floor eatery.</span>
            <a href="https://www.booking.com/city/jp/tokyo.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hotel-link">Check Rates &rarr;</a>
